WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — lut6-codon-nucleus (zu) · microsoft-edge-neural

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:18.924
<v Narrator>Okuqala, iziseli eziphilayo zisebenzisa ama-triplets ezinhlobo eziyisishiyagalombili nesikhombisa ukulondoloza imithetho yokuphila, futhi amathebula wokuhlola angaphakathi angama-6 wedijithali asebenzisa ngokufanayo ama-swiches ayishumi nesishiyagalolunye.

2
00:00:19.004 --> 00:00:31.981
<v Narrator>Okulandelayo, ukuqoqa izilungiselelo zesixhumi esincane esiseduze kanye nokwenza amaphutha ancane noma ukubhala i-glitches ngenkathi kususwa umsindo ophezulu wezinga eliphezulu.

3
00:00:32.061 --> 00:00:49.390
<v Narrator>Ngomthathu, i-kilobyte engu-16 core isebenza ngezikhono eziqinisekisiwe kuma-nanoseconds kusuka ku-microcontrollers wedola elinhlanu kuya kumakhadi e-M.2 angekho emthethweni, ukuvula amamodeli amakhulu kuphela ngeqiniso elisemthethweni.
